 "title": "Register of Deeds | huroncounty",
 "text": "-->\nRegister of Deeds | huroncounty\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nHuron County\nYour Welcoming Neighbor\nCommunity Info\nSmart 911 Signup\nAccessibility\nHome\nMeetings Calendar\nElections\nDepartments\nEmployment Opportunities\nForms & Applications\nRFP's\nProjects\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nLog In\nRegister of Deeds\n250 East Huron Avenue\nRoom 203\nBad Axe, MI 48413\nPhone: 989-269-9941\nFax: 989-269-8786\n​\nLand Laredo Search\nLand Tapestry Search\nProperty Fraud Alert (external)\nNotary Fraud Alert (external)\nGIS - Fetch\nFees\nRecording Requirements\nTransfer Tax Info\nTransfer Tax Exemptions\nTransfer Tax Table\nMisc\nRegister of Deeds\nWelcome to the Huron County Register of Deeds.\nLand record indexes are available online from 1947 to the present. All other land records dating back to 1848 are available in our office.\nLand Laredo Search Info\nProperty Fraud Alert Info\nE-recording\nHuron County Register of Deeds is now accepting documents submitted electronically (e-recording). Save time and postage by contacting one of the following companies.\nSimplifile: 1-800-460-5657\nCSC: 1-866-652-0111\nMailing & Payment\nDocuments can be hand delivered or mailed for recording. Correct fees must accompany the recordings. Checks, money orders, cash and credit cards are acceptable for payment. Checks can be made payable directly to the Register of Deeds. Please check all documents and fees thoroughly before submitting.\nOffice Hours\nMonday - Friday 8:30 a.m. - 4:30 p.m. except for Holidays\n(open during noon lunch hour)\nStaff\nSarah Durr – Register of Deeds\ndurrs@co.huron.mi.us\n​\nChristine Volmering – Chief Deputy Regist er\nCarrie Stanton – Deputy Register\n​\n250 E. Huron Ave\nBad Axe, MI 48413\n​\n​\nCounty Court Hours:\n8:30 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\nMonday through Friday\n​\nCounty Office Hours:\n8:00 a.m. – 4:30 p.m.\nMonday through Friday\nHuron County Building\nHuron County is committed to making our website accessible to all users, including those with disabilities. If you have specific questions or feedback about this site’s accessibility or need assistance using specific features, please email the Huron County CIS department at cis@co.huron.mi.us.\nHome\nMeetings Calendar\nElections\nDepartments\nEmployment Opportunities\nForms & Applications\nRFP's\nProjects\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nbottom of page",
